> Today['s cross]word[ puzzle clue is a] cryptic one[: Type of] party – ring mobile phone to[ get through.] We[ will] try to find[ the right answer to this particular crossword clue.] Here are the[ possible solutions for "]Type[ of] party – ring mobile phone to get through" clue[.] It was last seen in The Daily Telegraph cryptic crossword. We have[ 1] possible[ answer in] our[ database.]
