> Everybody like to bowl right!!! See the attached flyer and[ come] support our new projects in the Village of Lewiston and at The Arc Eric County Green Acres School were Mason and Matthew go to school.
For[ 200 for] a[ team] of[ 4 you get shoes], all[ you] can eat and drink and[ three hours] of bowling[.]
Cannot get[ a team, an] we can pair[ you] up with others. Cost 60 bucks[.] So get you[ team] and the most[ creative team name wins a prize.] Save money too[ with a team] of[ 4.]
